# Damon, skipper of the Swallow, on the pier. Four questions: the cargo, the
# strait, where they spend the night (the light beyond the ships), and passage
# out of the city. No question names what he has not said.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
Damon: NPC_SAILOR_1
- LOC_SAILOR_CHOICE_1
	Damon: NPC_SAILOR_2
	Damon: LOC_SAILOR_CARGO_1
- LOC_SAILOR_CHOICE_2
	Damon: NPC_SAILOR_3
	Damon: LOC_SAILOR_STRAIT_1
- LOC_SAILOR_CHOICE_3
	Damon: NPC_SAILOR_4
	Damon: LOC_SAILOR_LIGHT_1
	Damon: LOC_SAILOR_LIGHT_2
- LOC_SAILOR_CHOICE_4
	Damon: NPC_SAILOR_5
	Damon: LOC_SAILOR_LEAVE_1
=> END
